{"about_the_game":"Karina Katana is a classic 2D-style action adventure in a world divided into individual levels with 8 exciting biomes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou level up your skills to traverse the different worlds and fight 8 different types of enemies.<br />\r\nEvery opponent has different strengths and weaknesses. You need to recognize these and use them against them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach enemy drops different items when you defeat them.<br />\r\nCollect your opponents' items and use them to improve your weapons and skills in the shop.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFind new weapons in the newly unlocked biomes and unlock new skins by playing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach level also has a timer with which you can see your speed so you can be faster next time.<br />\r\nYou can also get up to 3 badges for different challenges for each level.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fashionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/4589e601ec2d69247ddaf239e84c73e938aafb9a.jpg"},{"name":"Last Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/20ea18af51dad1331bcc709d5d37392fb201db75.jpg"},{"name":"Hardcore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/db0181f10ab88ddf8fc3f629d1033ae1897f84f3.jpg"},{"name":"Bamboozled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/6454c8fb1840196656fe3170e4dfac02302f2715.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/c04df596c6ff8fcbae8aec2490632d435bb7a0b7.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/73e91140c9487aa18edb76aa4d24cc0b782de1b7.jpg"},{"name":" Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2731530/c12adc185cd5eee2bfa0f4afd9bf7f9576463df6.jpg"},{"name":"Touch Grass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam